* EMMW1 -- EDMMST client add/update screen
* All entry fields are unprotected.
MAP EMMW1 SIZE 24x80
  FIELD HEADER   AT 0,2   LEN 60 PROT BRIGHT  COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD CLIENTID AT 3,20  LEN 8  UNPROT BRIGHT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD CLTYPE   AT 4,20  LEN 1  UNPROT BRIGHT COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD RANK     AT 4,30  LEN 2  UNPROT BRIGHT COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD LNAME    AT 5,20  LEN 20 UNPROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN
  FIELD FNAME    AT 5,42  LEN 15 UNPROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN
  FIELD DEPT     AT 6,20  LEN 20 UNPROT DIM    COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD LOC      AT 6,45  LEN 3  UNPROT DIM    COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD MESSAGE  AT 9,5   LEN 60 PROT   DIM    COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD FOOTER   AT 23,2  LEN 60 PROT   DIM    COLOR=BLUE
ENDMAP
